call circle [Draws a filled circle.]
  center point [(380, 90)] 2 [the middle of the circle, a point]
  r number [40] 0 [the radius in pixels]
  fill color [#e0a526] 0 [the color inside]
call star [A five-point star.]
  center point [(10, 10)] 2 [where it is]
  points number [5] 0 []
  r number [30] 0 [how big]
call stroke [Draws a smooth curve that passes through every point. One point is a dot and two are a straight line. The ends are round.]
  points array [[(1, 2), (3, 4)]] 2 [the spots the curve goes through, a list of points]
  color color [#1d1d1f] 0 [the color of the line]
  width missing [] 0 [the thickness in pixels]
